  "query_preview": "Outlook: Ensembles strongly agree that upper-level \nridging will quickly rebuild across the region later in the week. \nBy late week, expect afternoon high temperatures to rebound into \nthe 60s across western Montana and the 70s across the lower \nelevations of central Idaho. Dry air and light winds will allow \novernight lows to remain quite chilly. The next chance of \nwidespread precipitation looks to be around Oct 20th but low \nconfidence at this point.",
